<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Continental cut. [CORRECTED 21:28 GMT]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Continental cut. [CORRECTED 21:28 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert Fleming analyst Raquel Lizarraga has cut her rating for Peru's Banco Continental to reduce from long-term buy.</p>
<p>The company's shares were off 0.10 soles to 3.90 soles Wednesday in Lima. (Eliminates reference to American Depositary Receipts).</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
